---
// src/pages/concept/sandy-city-inn/our-town.astro
import SandyCityLayout from '@/layouts/SandyCityLayout.astro';
import TownSpot from '@/components/sandy-city-inn/TownSpot.astro';
import { townPicks } from '@/data/town-picks';
---

<SandyCityLayout
  title="Our Town"
  description="Discover Sandy City, a walkable university town on the Lake Michigan shoreline with cafés, bookstores, beaches, and nearby dunes."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="container-wide max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-eyebrow mb-4">Our town</p>

      <h1
        class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold text-stone-900 leading-[1.05] mb-8"
      >
        Sandy City, on the Lake Michigan shoreline.
      </h1>

      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Sandy City is a university town where the shoreline, downtown, and
        surrounding natural areas are all part of everyday life. It’s easy to
        spend a morning outdoors, an afternoon exploring town, and an evening
        back at the inn.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-stone-700 leading-relaxed">
        These are some of the places we recommend to guests visiting for the
        first time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Town photo -->
  <section class="pb-12 md:pb-16">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <img
        src="/images/inn/sandy-city-inn-town-pier-sunset.webp"
        alt="Sandy City — the pier at sunset, the bell tower above the trees"
        class="w-full h-56 md:h-72 lg:h-96 object-cover rounded-lg border sci-border"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="container-wide max-w-3xl">
      <div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-stone-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          One of the things we enjoy most about Sandy City is its balance. It
          has the energy of a university town without feeling busy, and the
          shoreline is never far away.
        </p>

        <p>
          Downtown is easy to explore on foot, with locally owned cafés,
          bookstores, restaurants, galleries, and neighborhood shops. Throughout
          the year there are lectures, performances, markets, and community
          events that bring people together.
        </p>

        <p>
          Beyond downtown you'll find beaches, wooded trails, quiet overlooks,
          and miles of Lake Michigan shoreline. A short drive north leads to the
          dunes, one of our favorite places in every season.
        </p>

        <p>
          Every guest comes for something different. Some spend the day hiking.
          Others browse bookstores, enjoy long lunches, or simply walk to the
          water with a cup of coffee. That's one of the things we appreciate
          most about living here: there isn't just one way to enjoy the town.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Picks -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 border-t sci-border">
    <div class="container-wide max-w-4xl">
      <p class="text-eyebrow mb-3">Our recommendations</p>

      <h2
        class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-stone-900 leading-tight mb-12"
      >
        A few favorite places.
      </h2>

      <div>
        {
          townPicks.map((pick) => (
            <TownSpot
              number={pick.number}
              title={pick.title}
              category={pick.category}
              body={pick.body}
            />
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Closing -->
  <section class="py-24 md:py-32 border-t sci-border sci-band">
    <div class="container-wide max-w-2xl text-center">
      <h2
        class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-stone-900 leading-tight mb-6"
      >
        There's always something worth exploring.
      </h2>

      <p class="text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Whether you're here for the lake, the university, the restaurants, or a
        quiet weekend away, we're always happy to share a few suggestions to
        help you make the most of your visit.
      </p>

      <a href="/concept/sandy-city-inn/visit/" class="btn-primary">
        Plan your visit
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</SandyCityLayout>
```
